{"id":"probablemente","lemma":"probablemente","pos":"adv","rank":346,"glosses":["probably, likely"],"ipa":"/pɾoˌbableˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/83/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-probablemente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom probablemente sabía quién era yo.","en":"Tom probably knew who I was.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806458","words":[null,null,{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"I"}]},{"text":"Probablemente, yo habría hecho lo mismo.","en":"I probably would've done the same thing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460021","words":[null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"done, completed"},null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"perhaps"]]},{"text":"Probablemente seré yo quien tendrá que hacer eso.","en":"I'm probably the one who'll have to do that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/427922","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"Probablemente, podría haberlo hecho sin tu ayuda.","en":"I probably would've been able to do that without your help.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/456765","words":[null,{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"done, completed"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"help, aid"}]},{"text":"Ella probablemente vendrá.","en":"She'll probably come.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453659","words":[{"g":"she"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"venir"}]}]}